  "description": "Hard legendary-final theme — Shiori Kuze, 'Zero Signal' (Hard S30, Amanagi Dawnline). A separate composition from The Surveyor: restrained, patient and dawn-lit, in D major with a Lydian G#. It opens with a breathy whistle stating the Dawn Line over clean-guitar arpeggios and air pads, gathers momentum from a half-time pulse, widens with strings, and arrives at a full but unhurried groove where the Dawn Line and a major-key Call Sign finally answer each other. A bell-only dawn break precedes a last climb that loops back to the quiet momentum.",
